            "globaldata_ancestor_fk": [1],
            "browser_page_title": "Boston | Offices",
            "meta_keywords": "massachusetts, law, lawyer, attorney, counsel, committment, breadth, depth, results, community, service, pro bono, labor, employment, litigation, business, services, employee, benefits, litigators, practice",
            "meta_description": "The Boston office was opened in 1999 with two partners and five associates. The office has experienced substantial growth since then with a large group of lawyers joining the firm in 2001 as a result of a merger with the corporate firm Chappell White. In the spring of 2002, the firm added immigration and labor and employment teams from Palmer \u0026 Dodge. Additional partner acquisitions created the foundation for a commercial litigation practice in the office.",
