            "meta_keywords": "california, law, lawyer, attorney, counsel, committment, breadth, depth, results, community, service, pro bono, labor, employment, litigation, business, services, employee, benefits, litigators, practice",
            "meta_description": "The Sacramento office was opened in 1990 and is composed of labor and employment, employee benefits, litigation, trade secrets, and government contracts attorneys. Attorneys in our Sacramento office represent clients throughout California and the Western States. Attorneys and staff work in a collegial teamwork environment and are involved in a variety of organizations that benefit the local community.",
